user is reporting about their device clock not showing correct time.
They're in Central time, but clock shows Eastern.
This problem affects their company meeting times.

The user has followed these troubleshootings before sending me the message:
- I noticed it's set to Eastern but I'm in Central
- Restarted my computer - no change

I have to remote desktop into the users PC to continue the investigation.

I visit the Date & time section in Settings and change the time from Eastern to Central time
and allow it to sync the clock.

This solved the problem and ticket is closed.
